<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθρῴσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap upon</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηὸς ἐπιθρῴσκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.515
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				100
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>leap</i> (contemptuously) <i>upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύμβῳ ἐπιθρῴσκων Μενελάου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.177
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>leap
				over</i> a space, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόσσον
			ἐπιθρῴσκουσι</span> so far <i>do</i> [the horses] <i>spring
				at a bound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.772
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρὰ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				438
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>jut</i>
			<i>out</i>, of a rock, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				1266
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>.
			<i>rise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμίχλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Musae.
					113
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
